            "allow_multiple_open": true,
            "question_1": "Do you offer free shipping?",
            "answer_1": "<p>Yes. We offer free shipping on every order within UK, with no minimum purchase required.<br/><br/></p>",
            "open_1": true,
            "question_2": "How long does delivery take?",
            "answer_2": "<p>Orders are processed within 1–3 business days. After shipping, delivery typically takes an additional 3–8 business days, for a total of approximately 4–11 business days. As soon as your order ships, you'll receive a tracking email.<br/><br/></p>",
            "open_2": true,
            "question_3": "What is Dujje?",
            "answer_3": "<p>Dujje is an online fashion store built around carefully curated clothing that combines style, comfort, and lasting quality, making it easy to dress well every day.<br/><br/></p>",
            "open_3": false,
            "question_4": "Can I modify or cancel my order?",
            "answer_4": "<p>If your order has not yet been shipped, please contact us as soon as possible at <a href=\"mailto:support@dujje.com\" title=\"mailto:support@dujje.com\">support@dujje.com</a>, and we'll do our best to assist you.<br/><br/></p>",
            "open_4": false,
            "question_5": "Do you ship internationally?",
            "answer_5": "<p>At the moment, we only deliver within UK.<br/><br/></p>",
            "open_5": false,
            "question_6": "What is your return policy?",
            "answer_6": "<p>You have 60 days from the date of delivery to request a return. Simply email us at <a href=\"mailto:support@dujje.com\" title=\"mailto:support@dujje.com\">support@dujje.com</a>, and we'll guide you through the process step by step.<br/><br/></p>",
            "open_6": false,
            "question_7": "How long do refunds take?",
            "answer_7": "<p>Once we receive and inspect your returned item, we'll process your refund within 7 business days. Depending on your bank or card provider, it may take a few additional days for the refund to appear in your account.<br/><br/></p>",
            "open_7": false,
            "question_8": "Do you offer exchanges?",
            "answer_8": "<p>Yes. If you need a different size or would like to exchange your item for another product, contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@dujje.com\" title=\"mailto:support@dujje.com\">support@dujje.com</a>, and we'll arrange the exchange.<br/><br/></p>",
            "open_8": false,
            "question_9": "Is my payment information secure?",
            "answer_9": "<p>Absolutely. All payments are protected with SSL encryption, and your card details are never stored on our servers.<br/><br/></p>",
            "open_9": false,
            "question_10": "My order hasn't arrived yet. What should I do?",
            "answer_10": "<p>First, check the tracking link included in your shipping confirmation email. If something doesn't seem right, contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@dujje.com\" title=\"mailto:support@dujje.com\">support@dujje.com</a>, and we'll be happy to help.<br/><br/></p>",
            "open_10": false,
            "question_11": "Still have a question?",
            "answer_11": "<p>Feel free to contact us anytime at <a href=\"mailto:support@dujje.com\" title=\"mailto:support@dujje.com\">support@dujje.com</a>. Our team is always happy to help you find what you need.<br/><br/></p>",
